              "# North Dakota Farmer Says If Trump 'Doesn't Lose 100 Percent' of His Farm-belt Support Over Trade War 'People Are Kind of Crazy'\nDonald Trump's trade war with China is hemorrhaging support from his rural base which helped put him into the White House, farmers hit financially by his policies have warned",
