              "# Truckers and farmers who voted for Trump are starting to blame his policies for their economic woes\nOn Monday, Trump reportedly had to have a two-hour Cabinet meeting about increasing blowback from farmers. Trump campaigned in Iowa with the promise to support ethanol, which helped secured the vote from the state's 140,000 farmers, who are largely involved in corn.",
